mapping "b2702.1" source="b2702" target="SNOMED_CT:397624008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b2702 SNOMED CT 397624008 = ICF pressure-sensation subfunction under b270 Sensory functions
        related to temperature and other stimuli (the somatic afferent sense of mechanical pressure on
        skin/deep tissue). Target SNOMED CT 4265871 (sctid 397624008) =, active RF2 production. Broader:
        ICF groups pressure under the tactile/touch modality (light-touch and firm/pressure-touch are
        its sub-types in SNOMED CT: 247311004 light touch and 247313001 firm pressure touch are children of
        touch sensation). No SNOMED CT exists; touch sensation is the nearest standard function that fully
        subsumes pressure as a sub-modality. (high): one-level broader map to a verified-active function
        concept, well-understood breadth mismatch.
        """
}
assessment "b2703.omop" source="b2703" outcome=no_match target-system="OMOP_EXT"
