mapping "b2800.1" source="b2800" target="SNOMED_CT:22253000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b2800 SNOMED CT 22253000 = ICF sensation of generalized pain (pain perceived as
        widespread/non-localized across the body). Target SNOMED CT 4329041 (sctid 22253000) =, active
