        no dedicated active finding distinct from the Pain root (762590006 is chronic-primary
        generalized pain — a narrower disorder, not the function/symptom); 22253000 is the general-pain
        parent that the qualifier narrows toward. Mapped as exact_match at : the source's is the general
        Pain finding qualified by extent; no independent crosswalk, exact term-match at the general-pain
        level. (High tier: small breadth nuance, not independently crosswalk-verified.)
        """
}
